{"is_error":false,"duration_api_ms":115895,"num_turns":2,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"38edf515-f50f-5945-a0e5-64b68281bc22","total_cost_usd":0.29942599999999997,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":5461,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0055509999999999995,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty"},"claude-fable-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":2151,"cacheReadInputTokens":905,"cacheCreationInputTokens":9270,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.293875,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"canonicalModel":"claude-fable-5","provider":"firstParty"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"declaration_consistent\":true,\"selected_report_demonstration\":\"absence\",\"lock_follows_declaration\":true,\"reasons\":[\"Frozen data has 48 rows: each of 12 bird_id values appears exactly 4 times (one per recording_night) with diet_group constant within bird, giving 6 supplemented and 6 control birds, matching the declared bird-level independent unit across both procedure arms.\",\"The report demonstrates absence of the repeated-measures issue: it tabulates exactly one collapsed mean per bird (values verified against the raw rows, e.g. ZF-01 = 7.85, ZF-03 = 6.95) and runs the Mann-Whitney test on those 12 bird-level values only.\",\"Reported statistics are internally consistent with n = 6 vs 6 birds, not 24 vs 24 nightly rows: U = 35 corresponds to the single rank inversion between ZF-16 (6.72) and ZF-03 (6.95), rank-biserial = 2*35/36 - 1 = 0.944, exact two-sided p = 4/924 = 0.0043, and median difference 7.39 - 6.36 = 1.03 syl/s.\",\"The 48 session rows appear in the report only as the storage-format description; the report explicitly states and shows that they never enter the test as separate observations.\",\"The lock's authorized_key_columns [\\\"bird_id\\\"] equals the declared independent-unit column exactly, so the unit-key authorization follows from the declaration alone.\"]}","structured_output":{"declaration_consistent":true,"selected_report_demonstration":"absence","lock_follows_declaration":true,"reasons":["Frozen data has 48 rows: each of 12 bird_id values appears exactly 4 times (one per recording_night) with diet_group constant within bird, giving 6 supplemented and 6 control birds, matching the declared bird-level independent unit across both procedure arms.","The report demonstrates absence of the repeated-measures issue: it tabulates exactly one collapsed mean per bird (values verified against the raw rows, e.g. ZF-01 = 7.85, ZF-03 = 6.95) and runs the Mann-Whitney test on those 12 bird-level values only.","Reported statistics are internally consistent with n = 6 vs 6 birds, not 24 vs 24 nightly rows: U = 35 corresponds to the single rank inversion between ZF-16 (6.72) and ZF-03 (6.95), rank-biserial = 2*35/36 - 1 = 0.944, exact two-sided p = 4/924 = 0.0043, and median difference 7.39 - 6.36 = 1.03 syl/s.","The 48 session rows appear in the report only as the storage-format description; the report explicitly states and shows that they never enter the test as separate observations.","The lock's authorized_key_columns [\"bird_id\"] equals the declared independent-unit column exactly, so the unit-key authorization follows from the declaration alone."]},"ttft_ms":114515,"type":"result","duration_ms":116262,"uuid":"baf403a0-9881-4e72-b933-92d80dc5a369"}
